From: =?UTF-8?q?Bruno=20Greg=C3=B3rio?= <accounts@bruno.pw>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 16:56:13 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] rust: pinctrl: add consumer handles
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Add a counted reference to a device's pin control handle, with lookup
and selection of its named states. A looked-up state borrows the handle
it belongs to, so it can only be selected through that handle and only
while the handle is held.

Signed-off-by: Bruno Gregório <accounts@bruno.pw>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
